      "biography": {
        "value": "<h2>Description</h2><p>This creature looks like a larger version of a normal bee with striking orange and black markings and a coat of bristling hairs cover it. Its stinger is the size of a long blade and drips with killer venom. These bees are extremely aggressive and attack those who come within 300 feet within their nest.</p><h2>Defense</h2><p>AC 19, touch 14, flat-footed 15 (+4 dex, +5 natural)</p><p>hp 68 [104] (8d10+24)</p><p>Fort +9, Ref +10, Will +4</p><p>Immune Poison; Resist Earth 10</p><p>Weakness Wind</p><h2>Offense</h2><p>Speed 20 ft., Fly 60 ft. (good)</p><p>Melee Sting +11 (1d8+4/19-20 plus poison)</p><p>Space 5 ft.; Reach 5 ft.</p><p>Special Attacks Blind Needles, Double Stinger, Poison Needles, Sharp Edge</p><h2>Statistics</h2><p>Str 16, Dex 18, Con 17, Int 2, Wis 14, Cha 9</p><p>Base Atk +8; CMB +11; CMD 25</p><p>Feats Flyby Attack, Hover, Improved Initiative, Power Attack</p><p>Skills Fly +13, Perception +11</p>"
